FzY4kKs8", "review": {"bookId": "41605133", "content": "用新词去覆盖污染已经存在的概念，这个问题在互联网时代愈演愈烈。", "bookVersion": 1500898888, "range": "1137-1183", "abstract": "顺便说一句，揭示单纯事物是如何被观念或话语覆盖和污染的，是《没有个性的人》最重要的主题之一。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7FzY4kKs8", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1674809978, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "41605133", "format": "epub", "version": 1256861122, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/31/YueWen_41605133/s_YueWen_41605133.jpg", "title": "文明的边界（大家读大家）", "author": "格非", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "群英会", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 5}}